exports[`TUI rendering > help overlay lists every binding 1`] = `
"orbit │ mock · Demo mode │ ● live │ 0/2 running                                                                   ? help
╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║  Keys                                                                                  ║
║  Tab / Shift-Tab, h l, 1 2 3 move between Bots, Timeline and Approvals                 ║
║  j k / ↓ ↑                   move the selection (Timeline: scroll)                     ║
║  [ ]                         older / newer Run of the selected Bot                     ║
║  r                           run the selected Bot now                                  ║
║  p                           pause / resume the selected Bot                           ║
║  s                           stop the selected Run (Timeline)                          ║
║  u                           resume a parked or rate-limited Run (Timeline)            ║
║  g G                         Timeline top / follow live                                ║
║  a                           approve the selected card                                 ║
║  A                           approve and always allow this tool for the Bot (7 days)   ║
║  d                           deny, with a reason the Bot will see                      ║
║  K                           global kill switch (asks first)                           ║
║  R                           refresh                                                   ║
║  ?                           this help                                                 ║
║  q                           quit (Bots keep running in orbitd)                        ║
║  Edit-then-approve: orbit approve <id> --edit … · ? or Esc closes                      ║
╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
Tab/h/l panes · j/k move · r run · a/d approve/deny · K kill · ? help · q quit"
`;

